          "kind": "code",
          "language": "html",
          "code": "<neat-diagram [diagram]=\"system\" label=\"The demo's system\" [(level)]=\"level\">\n  <ng-template neatDiagramNote let-note>…</ng-template>\n</neat-diagram>"
